ced choices becomes intuitive with the multi-level choice system.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022700/extras/068a59eb4de304de88616f98f47db642.poster.avif?t=1746038150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022700/extras/068a59eb4de304de88616f98f47db642.webm?t=1746038150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022700/extras/068a59eb4de304de88616f98f47db642.mp4?t=1746038150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Friends, foes, and an engaging story</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will meet many characters on your journey. Choose how to interact with them.<br></li><li>Who can help you, who can be trusted, and who knows more about your secret ancestry?<br></li><li>Enjoy the coherent artwork, sound and music enriching the experience.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022700/extras/67a60b5cb267ece127991c230507a0b2.avif?t=1746038150\" /></div>",
